{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Boardly 是一款為 iPhone 而設的看板式專案管理應用，適合軟件開發團隊、市場推廣人員、產品經理及需要整理個人目標的用戶。它以原生 iOS 介面配合本機優先資料庫，離線亦可順暢操作。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>靈活看板與完整任務管理</h2>\n<p>應用提供無限看板與自訂欄目，可拖放調整並以橫向捲動瀏覽。任務支援四級優先度、到期日、預計與實際工時、子任務進度及相依關係，並設有八種自訂欄位，方便記錄客戶資料或預算。附件可加入檔案、圖片、PDF 及語音錄音，並透過 CloudKit 分享看板與設定權限。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-97-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-98-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-99-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-100-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-101-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-102-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Kanban Notes &amp; Tasks – Boardly</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T10:38:29.682076+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}